Provenance
----------
This package is the agent subsystem of TraderX (product name "QuantRiskPro
V2.0"), a trading-management system prototype the author wrote alone in
2025-2026. The TraderX repository is private; none of its documents or data
files are included here.

The code was copied from TraderX backend-python/src/agents (plus
src/core/mock_guard.py, two API route modules and the agent tests) at
revision 156d265e on 2026-11-12, into a fresh git history. Everything the
host system used to provide - a database session, a strategy registry,
portfolio storage, an EOD price service, an event-driven backtest engine - is
now reached through agentrt.ports. The exact list of changes made during the
extraction is in docs/PROVENANCE.md.

Source files keep the headers they had in TraderX ("Copyright 2025 TraderX.
All rights reserved." / "SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0"). "TraderX" is a
name the author used for that project; the files are distributed here under
the Apache License, Version 2.0, consistent with those SPDX tags.

Third-party software
--------------------
No third-party source code is bundled. Runtime dependencies (pydantic,
anthropic, httpx, PyYAML; optional openai, google-generativeai, numpy, pandas,
scipy, fastapi, watchdog, quantrisk-core) are installed separately under their
own licenses. The example skill definitions under examples/skills were written
by the author; skill packs from other projects that lived alongside them in
the original repository were not copied.
